1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Paid extra for nitrogen in your tires?
Here's what it actually does.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Regular air is already ~78% nitrogen.
The fill just pushes that to 95%+.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Real benefit: bigger molecules leak
through rubber a little slower.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Not a substitute for checking pressure —
cold weather still drops it.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Worth checking monthly either way.
Stop by and we'll take a look.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Nick's Tire & Auto
